      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْفَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْفٌ</span>, latter half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>An open,
elongated, tract of land, producing plants,</i> or
<i>herbage.</i> (O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, (O, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْفٌ</span></b> ,
(TA,) <i>A limit</i> (O, K, TA) between two things:
(K:) [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُرْفَةٌ</span>:] pl. of the former <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرَفٌ</span>. (O,
K, TA.)

